Independence and trademarks

pegcraft is an independent project. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by or derived from
Toon Boom Animation Inc. or its products. Product names such as Harmony are trademarks of
their owners and are used only to say which file format this project reads. It does not use
proprietary code, documentation, assets or the contents of any installation.

The readers in sightread/ are the clean-room core: their method and provenance are documented
and audited (sightread/NOTICE, sightread/docs/PROCEDENCIA.md). The rest of pegcraft (baking,
deformers, rasterizers, viewer) is a demonstration wrapper around that core; its provenance has
not been through the same process, and it is being replaced piece by piece by parts built with
the sightread method.

